{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "cd4f413fb8edcf11ae0bb430ecb6860f6568a72c5c66f8cc3ced522e833c0b8a", "ja": "ギャル学講座！　期末テスト", "zh": "辣妹学讲座！　期末考试", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d5ed4f752f0d5e806be26bcdd6895929242a71b5b90c8d329a9fd45b3edd1bcc", "ja": "特番はいよいよクライマックス、アイドル達\nによるライブ。これまでの勉強のおかげで、\nみんなすっかりギャルっぽくなっていて……\nウチらの絆マジ最強！　ステージ、全力で\n楽しんでもろて。ブチアゲでよきよき☆", "zh": "特别节目终于迎来高潮——偶像们\n带来的演唱会。多亏了至今为止的学习，\n大家已经彻底变得很辣妹风了……\n咱们的羁绊真的是最强！舞台就请尽情\n享受吧。嗨到爆就对啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c919d85e26947f3ecdb46c2cbb5262d4aa121cd61028055cf21c4b856ef8a581", "ja": "（撮影は順調に進み、残すはステージのみ。\nその前に一息、休憩を貰えることになった）", "zh": "（拍摄顺利进行着，只剩下舞台部分了。在那之前，大家可以先休息一会儿。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "682b94a990384e180f14ef5b151ec1bbd6853a5096d7c2e5eaaf7ac60cce85c9", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。\nかなりギャルっぽくなってきたな！", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n已经越来越有辣妹范儿了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "d075f82f139a5c599633cd52d1aa80ff1572efeabc0020e20bf2a9b68260f9be", "ja": "ほんと？　そう見えてたら嬉しいな。\nマジでアゲなの～☆", "zh": "真的吗？如果看起来像那样，我会很开心的。\n真的超嗨的～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "3713cd987b4b2ae60a2e56240fc8a0adc8603087e812321dbdcc2a362aaae2d3", "ja": "だな。最初はわけわかんない企画だと\n思ったけど、だんだんバイブス上がって来た系。", "zh": "对啊。刚开始我还觉得这是个莫名其妙的企划，不过渐渐地也越来越嗨了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "f6eb0d56c0ec89e7b24a7954d1ca6131f500556131c454f606dad072af8150ad", "ja": "杏奈も……アゲ、です……。", "zh": "杏奈也……嗨起来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "02ec04e357b66a92d2a92ed9dbdfdf5fd186c3eb12bdc3e848f5d18bf524fb95", "ja": "そうか、みんなアゲならよかった。\nこの調子で、ステージも大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "这样啊，大家都很有干劲，那就好。\n照这个状态来看，舞台也没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "4a209d5c8c0b0ebd9160f1d2504ff3ea2a33d33bda0b6962946bae9fb4782053", "ja": "もちろん！　てか、ウチらの団結力なめんなしー。", "zh": "当然！不然怎么说，别小看咱们的团结力啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "16d8c546ebccc00c4a0fbc447996706728f9d23dec1e201f6f87f6ba5e18064f", "ja": "そーそー。あーしたち最強だしー？\nガチで世界救っちゃうレベル～？　みたいな～。", "zh": "对对。我们可是最强的嘛？\n感觉都强到能拯救世界了～？大概就是这样～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ec509507c154955e2567f1412c4263d5bf2ceea7078495dcc0c96aee6c752548", "ja": "ウッ！？　なんだかクラクラするぞ……。\nこのあたり、ギャル濃度がすごいな。", "zh": "呃！？怎么感觉有点头晕……  \n这一带的辣妹浓度也太高了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "8ef222770e593803e8387fd1b72129bfe0224a1f70729c12efeae47d21b57373", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん、\nこれくらいで、ダウンしちゃう系……？", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生，  \n这么点程度就要倒下的类型……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "7447f850d41ace3aa1b7286ddd38c8b3d50680ac0512a34ba8974da8e254216c", "ja": "ふふ……よわよわ{$P$}さん……。\nかわいい、です……♪", "zh": "呵呵……弱弱的{$P$}先生……好可爱……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "a7356f7139d4324c64adadfec0b084e8192dce490848041bb7d3e3c04c69de7b", "ja": "アンナ！　それ、ギャルとはちょっと違くないか？\nなんかこう……もっとヤバイ感じだ！", "zh": "安娜！那和辣妹有点不一样吧？\n该怎么说呢……感觉更不得了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_05_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "78b52b2c26a308923ed23198648695efe9d6baea070439a32cceeb785af962f0", "ja": "よわよわ{$P$}、\nすっごくいい表情してるの♪　ドキッとしちゃった？", "zh": "弱弱的{$P$}，表情真棒呀♪是不是心动了一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
